Qualify verified one-way IPv4 QinQ multicast with the default ECM policy.

In default reply-wait mode, the two classifiers inspect two slow-path
packets for a routed IPv4 multicast path accepted by the NSS rule builder.
Carry the eligibility with the packet. Keep the configured policy for
all other flows and revalidate the route before submitting an NSS rule.

